          "value": "<div style='box-sizing:border-box;width:100%;height:100%;padding:24px;font-family:system-ui;color:#dbeafe;background:#0b1220;border:1px solid #26364d;border-radius:18px'><b style='color:#67e8f9'>Drag a handle</b><p style='margin:12px 0 0;line-height:1.5'>Drag from the right-hand handle of a Sender to the Receiver. Each Sender wears its own Handle art, and the plain one wears the system handle. The art is the handle: it starts the connection.</p></div>"
